    <title lang="en">Wild Rockies</title>
    <desc lang="en">Where the mountains cross international borders, herds of elk and moose live side by side with predators like bears and wolves. The predator/prey relationship is a delicate balance, and the perfect place to see it in action is the Kootenay area of the Rocky Mountains.</desc>
    <category lang="en">Wildlife</category>
    <episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.0.</episode-num>
